    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "so basically you're saying the security arguments are mostly just excuses? i mean, can you actually name any country where these regulations aren't just a way for the government to stay in power? it feels like there isn't even a real \"legitimate\" way to do it without it turning into censorship.",
